      ],
      "source": "https://miltonnhhistory.org/about",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Milton Mills sits beside the Salmon Falls River, which marks the boundary between New Hampshire and Maine.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milton_Mills%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Through the Salmon Falls River, Milton Mills feeds into the larger Piscataqua River watershed.",
